# one address only: ajassociatesonline.com
# (also make it the primary domain in Netlify, so the netlify.app address redirects here too)
http://www.ajassociatesonline.com/*   https://ajassociatesonline.com/:splat   301!
https://www.ajassociatesonline.com/*  https://ajassociatesonline.com/:splat   301!
